'''Chroma Alienbeam''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[2025 Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]].

== Appearance ==
The Chroma Alienbeam is the chroma variant of the [[Alienbeam]], The Chroma Alienbeam changes color when equipped or on a player's side. However, It displays a solid multicolor when using the “/chromatoggle” command.

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart of the godly knife under the name [[Alienbeam]], which is obtained from the same box.
* It partners with the godly gun [[Chroma Raygun]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Alien Set|Chroma Alien Set]].

